      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Its more of a question - optimized for what purpose?\n\nWhose goal are we trying to reach by optimizing?\n\nIf my goal is to make an avatar come to life - it will be met with the performance expectations of whatever PS1 game they think they need to measure up to.\n\nTo make it worse the devs implement a system that instapoors an avatar for having a light source.\n\nYou never hear the vrc team say to not use full body tracking to increase performance.\n\nIts not just words, its blatant disregard for selective things and if you think their Chinese good \ncitizen approach is an accident you are not keeping your eyes open.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
